label.value:
${RACE:乔恩·布拉肯布鲁克（Jon Brackenbrook）希望与你交谈。

阿切特遭到袭击后，乔恩·布拉肯布鲁克回到小镇协助重建，继承了他父亲的遗产。'[U,D,L]|'Mundo Sackville-Baggins wishes to speak with you.

After the assault on Archet, you helped Mundo Sackville-Baggins and Celandine Brandybuck on their return trip to the Shire.'[O]}

${RACE:斯科吉（Skógi）希望与你交谈。

斯科格瑞姆之墓的事件已过去两年，但你仍留在蓝山（Blue Mountains）帮助长须矮人夺回他们的厅堂。[D]|Eilian wishes to speak with you.

Two years have passed since the events in Skorgrím's tomb, but you have remained in Ered Luin to help protect the Refuge of Duillond.}
